<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round, second leg results</p>
<p>in the Spanish Cup on Tuesday.</p>
<p> Celta Vigo	  1    Racing Ferrol     1</p>
<p>(Celta win 4-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Sporting Gijon    1    Toledo		0</p>
<p>(Sporting win 1-0 on aggregate)</p>
</text>
